.Pq Do CheriBSD feature extraction, maturity, and testing Dc .
.Dd November 27, 2026
.Dt CHERI_SEALCAP_ALLOC
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm cheri_sealcap_alloc
.Nd Allocate a compartment ID capability
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In cheri/sealcap.h
.Ft int
.Fn cheri_sealcap_alloc "uintcap_t *sealcapp"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn cheri_sealcap_alloc
allocates a unique-per-vmspace capability suitable for sealing and
unsealing capabilities.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Rv -std
.Sh ERRORS
The
.Fn cheri_sealcap_alloc
system call succeeds unless:
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Bq Er EFAULT
The argument
.Fa sealcapp
is not a valid pointer to storage capable of holding a uintcap_t.
.It Bq Er ENOMEM
No sealing types are available.
.It Bq Er ENOSYS
This platform does not support typed sealing.
.El
.Sh BUGS
A
.Fn cheri_sealcap_free
should exist to allow types to be reused after revocation.
